# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before starting this tutorial, be sure you have the following installed:\n"
"- Qiskit SDK v2.0 or later, with [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) support\n"
"- Qiskit Runtime v0.22 or later (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
"- Circuit cutting Qiskit addon v0.9.0 or later (`pip install qiskit-addon-cutting`)\n"
msgstr ""
"ก่อนเริ่มบทช่วยสอนนี้ ให้ตรวจสอบว่าได้ติดตั้งสิ่งต่อไปนี้แล้ว:\n"
"- Qiskit SDK v2.0 ขึ้นไป พร้อมรองรับ [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization)\n"
"- Qiskit Runtime v0.22 ขึ้นไป (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
"- Circuit cutting Qiskit addon v0.9.0 ขึ้นไป (`pip install qiskit-addon-cutting`)\n"

